@api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5183

GET {{api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Public payment details for the invitation page
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/payment-settings
Accept: application/json

###

### List guests (requires an Admin login cookie)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/guests
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a guest invitation (requires an Admin login cookie)
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/guests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Guest Name",
  "phone": "+1234567890"
}

###

### Delete a guest by ID (requires an Admin login cookie)
DELETE {{api_HostAddress}}/api/guests/1

###

### Save a wish using a guest's personal invitation token
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/guests/PASTE_INVITATION_TOKEN/wish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wish": "Wishing you a lifetime of love and happiness!"
}

###

### List recent public guest wishes
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/guests/wishes
Accept: application/json

###

### Confirm RSVP for a guest invitation token (0 means unable to attend)
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/guests/PASTE_INVITATION_TOKEN/rsvp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestCount": 2
}

###
